msgstr "允許未知用戶端"

#: modules/univention/admin/handlers/dhcp/sharedsubnet.py:24
msgid "An IP address range used in a shared network."
msgstr "共用網路中使用的 IP 位址範圍。"

#: modules/univention/admin/handlers/dhcp/host.py:52
msgid "Assign one or more fixed IP addresses. Each address should be either an IP address or a domain name that resolves to one or more IP addresses."
msgstr "指派一或多個固定 IP 位址。每個位址應為 IP 位址，或可解析為一或多個 IP 位址的網域名稱。"

#: modules/univention/admin/handlers/dhcp/server.py:30
msgid "Associate a service with a server."
msgstr "將服務與伺服器建立關聯。"

