#: modules/univention/admin/handlers/dhcp/host.py:45
msgid "Currently, only the ethernet and token-ring types are recognized. The hardware-address should be a set of hexadecimal octets (numbers from 0 through ff) separated by colons."
msgstr "目前僅辨識 ethernet 與 token-ring 類型。硬體位址應為一組以冒號分隔的十六進位八位元組 (0 到 ff 的數字)。"

